  "instance_name": "pork_unclean_dietary_law",
  "label": "Islamic Dietary Law: Pork is Unclean",
  "description": "This is a fundamental tenet of Islamic law (Sharia) derived from the Quran and Hadith, which explicitly prohibits the consumption of pork and pork products. The meme references this as a 'logic' point to set up the false equivalence with camel urine, which is not a dietary prohibition but a medicinal claim. The meme uses this well-known fact to create a misleading comparison, implying that if Muslims follow such 'logic', they must be irrational or hypocritical.",
